    {
      "id": "u_5ff4f07447180a5455d13e44_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Sometimes active content can cause issues with the UI or the server, preventing it from functioning properly. __TRILIUM_PH_0__Safe mode__TRILIUM_PH_1__ allows starting Trilium in such a way that active content is not loaded by default at start-up, allowing the user to fix the problematic scripts or widgets.",
      "sourceHash": "5ff4f07447180a5455d13e44b5d2778ba197cee290d0d28a7fd5213ab5d18da7",
      "context": "Active content > Safe mode",
      "contextHash": "26e2cc8f773b84e88d34aa40a6b57a005187defb1d77912b44502131df839d4a",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "アクティブコンテンツが原因でUIやサーバーに問題が発生し、正常に機能しなくなることがあります。__TRILIUM_PH_0__セーフモード__TRILIUM_PH_1__を使用すると、起動時にデフォルトでアクティブコンテンツが読み込まれないようにTriliumを起動できるため、ユーザーは問題のあるスクリプトやウィジェットを修正できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
