    {
      "id": "u_de6960b3439ca6fbd2deb40b_0",
      "kind": "td",
      "source": "Generally are more contained and less prone to cause issues, but they can cause performance issues (for example if the icon pack has millions of icons in it).",
      "sourceHash": "de6960b3439ca6fbd2deb40bbbfbfccaaaa5a7eb8ed40c2a669ae0fd5898285d",
      "context": "Active content > Types of active content",
      "contextHash": "66b8926486fd0f57c09d3771bd6f4fb02212efd8d3409f80233a28b91c54dc70",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "一般により限定的であり、問題を引き起こしにくいですが、パフォーマンスの問題を引き起こす可能性があります（例：アイコンパックに何百万ものアイコンが含まれている場合など）。",
      "conditions": {
