    {
      "id": "u_0ef80ee9c3a84e9b1f6d47bc_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If a note is considered to have active content, a badge is shown in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note badges__TRILIUM_PH_1__ area. Clicking the badge will reveal a menu with various options related to that content type, for example to open the documentation or to configure the execution of scripts.",
      "sourceHash": "0ef80ee9c3a84e9b1f6d47bc61f857b2ccf9683751ca39b858e2bb30f54e6d98",
      "context": "Active content > Active content badge",
      "contextHash": "dc55541a319c933e799c5577e0ee6176bd7ab0279c8fa8e866f3730d9e8504ca",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ノートにアクティブコンテンツが含まれていると見なされる場合、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ノートバッジ__TRILIUM_PH_1__エリアにバッジが表示されます。バッジをクリックすると、ドキュメントを開く、スクリプトの実行を構成するなど、そのコンテンツタイプに関連するさまざまなオプションを含むメニューが表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_74560681852a66a5e01a9cfe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For some active content types, such as backend scripts with custom triggering conditions a toggle button will appear. This makes it possible to easily disable scripts or widgets, but also to re-enable them if an import was made with safe mode active.",
      "sourceHash": "74560681852a66a5e01a9cfe1748faa9a74b25cccf76e185af95f9f48e35713c",
      "context": "Active content > Active content badge",
      "contextHash": "dc55541a319c933e799c5577e0ee6176bd7ab0279c8fa8e866f3730d9e8504ca",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "カスタムトリガー条件を持つバックエンドスクリプトなど、一部のアクティブなコンテンツタイプでは、トグルボタンが表示されます。これにより、スクリプトやウィジェットを簡単に無効化できるだけでなく、セーフモードが有効な状態でインポートされた場合に再度有効にすることも可能になります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    }
